        "block_type": "blockquote",
        "tag": "blockquote",
        "text": "What to Expect When You're Expecting , 5th edition, Heidi Murkoff. WhatToExpect.com, Baby Names , 2025. WhatToExpect.com, 8 Things to Keep in Mind When Choosing a Baby Name , September 2025. WhatToExpect.com, Should You Keep Your Baby’s Name a Secret? Why Some Parents Wait — and Others Don’t September 2025. Pamela Redmond Satran, co-founder of Nameberry. Raffi Bilek, L.C.S.W.-C., a family therapist and director of the Baltimore Therapy Center. Jennifer Moss, founder and CEO of BabyNames.com.",
